  "notes_by_direction": {
    "N": "Reviewed the full sixteen-pose contact sheet, actual normal idle/walk browser view and enlarged01/05/09/13/15/16. The left and right lower/back feet alternate at01/09. New05/13 swing forward underneath the hem after the rear-foot lifts instead of repeating a backward kick. Rear hair, lotus, bottle-left and lantern-right remain coherent, with no clipping at15/16/01.",
    "NE": "Reviewed all16 poses and normal/enlarged browser evidence. Repaired05/06 and13/14 move the opposite swing feet underneath the body;01/09 contacts differ and retain back-right facing. The heel shown at15/16 belongs to the returning leg and flows into01. The new passing poses bob slightly within the fixed-scale limit; actual idle/walk display remains coherent.",
    "E": "Reviewed all16 poses and actual normal/enlarged browser evidence. The near foreground thigh leads at01; at09 the broad near trailing thigh overlaps the narrower far leading thigh, making opposite contacts readable. Rebuilt06-13 transitions maintain the intended exchange. Crown, lotus, bottle near the chest and lantern ahead stay consistent;15/16/01 advances into the contact without a mirrored body.",
    "SE": "Reviewed all16 poses, normal idle/walk and enlarged contact/passing/seam screenshots.01/09 plant opposite legs,05/13 raise opposite knees, and07 is a forward reach before08/09 settles. Both held props remain on the correct hands and the smiling original face remains recognizable;15/16/01 closes with the returning foot advancing.",
    "S": "Reviewed all16 poses, normal idle/walk and enlarged01/05/09/13/15/16. Front-view01/09 visibly exchange left and right planted feet, with opposite knees raised at05/13. The lower body articulates through the intermediate poses while the lotus crown, brown hair, coral/ivory robe, bottle and lantern retain identity. The returning foot and gentle bob close15/16/01.",
    "SW": "After the prior review was withdrawn for incorrect shoe headings, six real image-edited poses07-12 were reimported. Inspected actual new300px browser06-13 screenshots and enlarged06-12, contacts01/09, passing05/13, and15/16/01 seam. Every corrected foreground shoe now has its lotus toe extending lower-left and heel upper-right. The near LEFT thigh remains in front at09, unlike01, and05/13 still raise opposite knees. Grounded near support persists09-12 as the far RIGHT knee rises. The original face remains three-quarterSW; foot-heading changes do not swap legs, hands or props. Root independently confirmed the repaired09 toe direction and retained occlusion.",
    "W": "Reviewed all16 poses, normal idle/walk and enlarged contact/passing/seam screenshots. Repaired01 has the broad near trailing thigh visibly in front of the narrower far forward thigh;09 has the opposite foreground leading leg. Rebuilt02-05 and14-16 maintain this exchange. The side face, bottle and lantern match the source identity;15/16/01 settles toward the same far-leg contact without extra feet.",
    "NW": "Reviewed all16 poses, normal idle/walk and enlarged contact/passing/seam screenshots.01/09 show alternate lower/back contact feet,05 and repaired13 are opposite forward passing movements. Repaired13-15 stay under the body instead of kicking sideways. Back-left facing, hair and props remain coherent;15/16/01 closes without a direction flip."
  },
